{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000052","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000052"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000052","label":"彭祖","status":"active","historicity":"legendary_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"彭祖","mention_ids":["c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0097"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0097","chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p024","quote":"彭祖"}],"identity_note":"僅依本篇上下文建立；不因同名自動跨篇合併。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-001","chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0097"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-001-wudi:p024"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-001-wudi"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"彭祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000052","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p024","chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:p024","text":"舜入于大麓，烈風雷雨不迷，堯乃知舜之足授天下。堯老，使舜攝行天子政，巡狩。舜得舉，用事二十年，而堯使攝政。攝政八年而堯崩。三年喪畢，讓丹朱，天下歸舜。而禹、皋陶、契、后稷、伯夷、夔、龍、倕、益、彭祖自堯時而皆舉用，未有分職。於是舜乃至於文祖，謀于四嶽，辟四門，明通四方耳目，命十二牧論帝德，行厚德，遠佞人，則蠻夷率服。舜謂四嶽曰：「有能奮庸美堯之事者，使居官相事？」皆曰：「伯禹爲司空，可美帝功。」舜曰：「嗟，然！禹，汝平水土，維是勉哉。」禹拜稽首，讓於稷、契與皋陶。舜曰：「然，往矣。」舜曰：「棄，黎民始飢，汝后稷，播時百穀。」舜曰：「契，百姓不親，五品不馴，汝爲司徒，而敬敷五教，在寬。」舜曰：「皋陶，蠻夷猾夏，寇賊姦軌，汝作士，五刑有服，五服三就；五流有度，五度三居：維明能信。」舜曰：「誰能馴予工？」皆曰垂可。於是以垂爲共工。舜曰：「誰能馴予上下草木鳥獸？」皆曰益可。於是以益爲朕虞。益拜稽首，讓于諸臣朱虎、熊羆。舜曰：「往矣，汝諧。」遂以朱虎、熊羆爲佐。舜曰：「嗟！四嶽，有能典朕三禮？」皆曰伯夷可。舜曰：「嗟！伯夷，以汝爲秩宗，夙夜維敬，直哉維靜絜。」伯夷讓夔、龍。舜曰：「然。以夔爲典樂，教稺子，直而溫，寬而栗，剛而毋虐，簡而毋傲；詩言意，歌長言，聲依永，律和聲，八音能諧，毋相奪倫，神人以和。」夔曰：「於！予擊石拊石，百獸率舞。」舜曰：「龍，朕畏忌讒說殄僞，振驚朕衆，命汝爲納言，夙夜出入朕命，惟信。」舜曰：「嗟！女二十有二人，敬哉，惟時相天事。」三歲一考功，三考絀陟，遠近衆功咸興。分北三苗。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000020","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000020","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000020","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000020","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"丹朱","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000026","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0076","start":76,"end":77,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wudi:m024-0081","start":81,"end":82,"surface":"契","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000045","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-001-wu